+// ================================================================
+// XIP State Machine
+// ================================================================
+// When the CPU reads from flash address space, this FSM:
+//   1. Writes SPI registers (DIV, SS, TX_1, CTRL) via Wishbone
+//   2. Polls CTRL until GO clears
+//   3. Reads RX_0, byte-swaps, and returns data via APB
+//
